{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mini Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/471a9384ebd3d9f55e87e5db0f7de005.poster.avif?t=1759422793\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/471a9384ebd3d9f55e87e5db0f7de005.webm?t=1759422793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/471a9384ebd3d9f55e87e5db0f7de005.mp4?t=1759422793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHIP BUILDING:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your ship with unique functional parts, equip railguns and versatile turrets. Fortify your ship with armor, shields, and radars to survive the harshest corners of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ORE TRADING:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade the ores that you gathered from mining asteroid to gain Credits. Use the credits to build your ship. Currently you can trade with any stations by docking your ship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMBAT:\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down fights where damage stacks until you command your droids to patch it.\u00a0Combat with space pirates and unknown entities with their weird behaviors.\u00a0Make sure your ship is pressurized, repair leaks with the help of your Droids that will prioritize healing in the middle of collecting ores for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer: Explore the galaxy in the Early Access version of Leaks in Space. Check out our Public Roadmap above, we'll keep working on the game and update the roadmap as development progresses.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561170?t=1759422793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/21738797f274031c4c8b0f15f05263cd21a7835f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759422793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6f8851411a82d1e2d9e40049a9474343b78c38a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759422793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6f8851411a82d1e2d9e40049a9474343b78c38a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759422793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3583820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>GAME ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b041450b7436c0a528ef2e6d670b921e.avif?t=1759422793\" width=780 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/088263ff4bd3bc049e7419038dc10d06.avif?t=1759422793\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mini Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=